      "subject": "ויחרקו שן",
      "rationale": "Go rikgetha meno — go kgwathantšha meno ka boloi, sebopego sa go laela bokgoba."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "בלענו",
      "rationale": "Bontši bja Sepedi bo oketšitšwe: Seheberu se re 're medile' ka botlalo (mme gona se bolela 'yena', e sego 'yena le mafase')."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "שרקו ויחרקו",
      "rationale": "Mokgwa wa go tšwalela dipolelo tše pedi tša go dupa — go khunama le go rikgetha — ditedu tša manaba ka moka."
    },
    {
      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "go Yerushalayime",
      "rationale": "Temana e bolela go morwadona wa Yerushalayime ka dikgetsi tša bobedi (עליך, אויביך)."
    }
  ],
